# logfilename                                              owner:group          mode count size(KB) when flags
#
# Short-lived StartInterval jobs (backup, monitor, retention) reopen their log
# on every run, so immediate bzip2 compression on rotation is safe.
{{LOG_ROOT}}/backup.stdout.log                            {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
{{LOG_ROOT}}/backup.stderr.log                            {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
{{LOG_ROOT}}/monitor.stdout.log                           {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
{{LOG_ROOT}}/monitor.stderr.log                           {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
{{LOG_ROOT}}/retention.stdout.log                         {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
{{LOG_ROOT}}/retention.stderr.log                         {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    *    JN
#
# Long-lived KeepAlive daemons hold their log fd open across rotations. Do NOT
# compress on rotation: bzip2 (J) unlinks the rotated file and orphans the open
# fd, losing every subsequent line and hiding the still-growing inode from disk
# accounting. Rotate daily and rely on the post-rotation `launchctl kickstart -k`
# step (ops/runbooks/deployment.md) to make each daemon reopen its fresh log.
{{LOG_ROOT}}/caddy.stdout.log                             {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/caddy.stderr.log                             {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/cloudflared.stdout.log                       {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/cloudflared.stderr.log                       {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/control.stdout.log                           {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/control.stderr.log                           {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/notification-worker.stdout.log               {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/notification-worker.stderr.log               {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/content-worker.stdout.log                    {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
{{LOG_ROOT}}/content-worker.stderr.log                    {{USER_NAME}}:staff  640  10    10240    $D0  N
